#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:14
msgid "Appendix E: :index:`Cover Art Processing <pair: cover art; processing>`"
msgstr "附录 E: :index:`封面图片处理 <pair: cover art; processing>`"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:16
msgid "This section explains how Picard handles cover art, from finding images to embedding them in your files."
msgstr "本节解释了 Picard 如何处理封面图片，从查找图片到将它们嵌入您的文件。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:19
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:21
msgid "Picard's cover art system has four stages:"
msgstr "Picard 的封面图片系统有四个阶段："

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:23
msgid "**Discovery** - Find available images from configured providers."
msgstr "**发现** - 从配置的提供程序中查找可用图片。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:24
msgid "**Filtering** - Decide which images to keep or skip."
msgstr "**过滤** - 决定要保留或跳过哪些图片。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:25
msgid "**Processing** - Resize and convert images for embedding or saving."
msgstr "**处理** - 调整大小并转换图片以嵌入或保存。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:26
msgid "**Assignment** - Copy images to files, respecting per-file protection rules."
msgstr "**分配** - 将图片复制到文件，并遵守每个文件的防护规则。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:30
msgid "Cover Art Providers"
msgstr "封面艺术提供者"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:32
msgid "Cover art providers are the sources Picard queries for cover art. They run in a user-configured priority order under the :doc:`../config/options_cover` configuration. Each provider can queue images for download."
msgstr ""
"封面艺术提供者是 Picard 查询封面艺术的来源。它们在用户配置的优先级顺序下运行"
"（在 :doc:`../config/options_cover` 配置中）。每个提供者都可以排队下载图片。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:35
msgid "Cover Art Archive (CAA)"
msgstr "封面艺术存档 (CAA)"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:37
msgid "The most common provider. The CAA stores images uploaded by MusicBrainz editors with metadata: image types (front, back, booklet, etc.), approval status, and available thumbnail sizes."
msgstr ""
"最常见的提供者。CAA 存储由 MusicBrainz 编辑上传的带有元数据的图片：图片类型（"
"正面、背面、封套等）、批准状态和可用的缩略图大小。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:39
msgid "**How it works:**"
msgstr "**工作原理：**"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:41
msgid "Picard fetches the CAA JSON metadata for the release (list of available images)."
msgstr "Picard 获取 CAA 的发行品 JSON 元数据（可用图片列表）。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:42
msgid "For each image, it checks:"
msgstr "对于每张图片，它检查："

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:43
msgid "Is the image approved, or is the edit on MusicBrainz adding the image still pending approval (if \"approved only\" is enabled)?"
msgstr ""
"图片是否已批准，或者 MusicBrainz 上添加图片的编辑是否仍在等待批准（如果启用"
"了 \"仅批准\"）？"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:44
msgid "Does the image's type match the include/exclude type filters?"
msgstr "图片类型是否与包含/排除类型过滤器匹配？"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:45
msgid "Is the image a PDF (only downloaded if \"save to files\" is enabled)?"
msgstr "图片是否为 PDF（如果启用了 \"保存到文件\" 则仅下载）？"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:46
msgid "For accepted images, Picard picks a thumbnail URL based on the configured image size preference (250px, 500px, 1200px, or full size)."
msgstr ""
"对于接受的图片，Picard 根据配置的图片大小偏好（250px、500px、1200px 或完整大"
"小）选择缩略图 URL。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:47
msgid "Before downloading, the **pre-download metadata filter** can reject images based on the thumbnail's known width. This is the only filter that saves bandwidth."
msgstr ""
"下载之前，**预下载元数据过滤器** 可以根据缩略图的已知宽度拒绝图片。这是唯一节"
"省带宽的过滤器。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:49
msgid "**CAA image sizes and bandwidth:**"
msgstr "**CAA 图片大小和带宽：**"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:51
msgid "The CAA has no upload size limit. Editors routinely upload 600 dpi scans that can exceed 15-30 MB per image, and some releases have 10+ images (front, back, booklet pages, disc, liner notes, etc.). A vinyl box set might have 50+ images."
msgstr ""
"CAA 没有上传大小限制。编辑通常会上传 600 dpi 扫描，每张图片可能超过 15-30 MB"
"，有些发行品有 10+ 张图片（正面、背面、封套页面、光盘、内页等）。一个黑胶盒装"
"集可能有 50+ 张图片。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:53
msgid "When \"Full size\" is selected, Picard downloads the original uploaded file which could be a 30 MB PNG scan at 4800x4800 pixels. For a release with 12 images, that's potentially 360 MB of downloads and significant processing time (resizing a 30 MB PNG is CPU-intensive)."
msgstr ""
"当选择 \"完整大小\" 时，Picard 下载原始上传的文件，该文件可能是一个 30 MB 的 "
"PNG 扫描，分辨率为 4800x4800 像素。对于一个有 12 张图片的发行品，这可能意味着"
"潜在的 360 MB 下载和显著的处理时间（调整 30 MB PNG 是 CPU 密集型的）。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:55
msgid "The thumbnail sizes (250px, 500px, 1200px) are pre-generated by the CAA servers and are much smaller file sizes(typically 50-500 KB). The default is 500px, which is a good balance between quality and bandwidth. The pre-download metadata filter can reject thumbnails below the minimum size threshold before downloading, which is the only point where bandwidth is actually saved."
msgstr ""
"缩略图大小（250px、500px、1200px）由 CAA 服务器预先生成，文件大小要小得多（通"
"常为 50-500 KB）。默认值是 500px，这是质量和带宽之间的良好平衡。预下载元数据"
"过滤器可以在下载之前拒绝低于最小大小阈值的缩略图，这是实际节省带宽的唯一点。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:57
msgid "**CAA-specific options:** |br| |nl| The following options only apply to the CAA provider, and are set in the :doc:`../config/options_cover_art_archive` configuration:"
msgstr ""
"**CAA特定的选项：** |br| |nl| 以下选项仅适用于CAA提供程序，并在:doc:`../"
"config/options_cover_art_archive`配置中设置："

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:60
msgid "Image size (thumbnail selection: 250px, 500px, 1200px, or full size)."
msgstr "图像大小（缩略图选择：250px、500px、1200px或全尺寸）。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:61
msgid "Restrict to specific image types (include/exclude lists)."
msgstr "限制为特定图像类型（包含/排除列表）。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:62
msgid "Only use approved images."
msgstr "仅使用批准的图像。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:65
msgid "Other Providers"
msgstr "其他提供程序"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:67
msgid "**CAA Release Group** - Falls back to the release group's cover art if there is no cover art for the specific release."
msgstr "**CAA发行组** - 如果特定发行品没有封面图片，则回退到发行组的封面图片。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:68
msgid "**Local Files** - Reads images from files in the same directory (e.g. ``cover.jpg``, ``folder.png``)."
msgstr ""
"**本地文件** - 从同一目录中的文件读取图像（例如 "
"``cover.jpg``、``folder.png``）。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:69
msgid "**URL Relationships** - Uses image URLs from MusicBrainz release relationships."
msgstr "**URL关系** - 使用MusicBrainz发行品关系中的图像URL。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:71
msgid "Plugins can register additional providers."
msgstr "插件可以注册额外的提供程序。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:75
msgid "Filtering"
msgstr "过滤"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:77
msgid "Filters determine whether an image should be kept or discarded. There are two stages of filtering with different purposes:"
msgstr "过滤器确定图像是否应该保留或丢弃。有两种不同目的的过滤阶段："

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:80
msgid "At Download Time (post-download)"
msgstr "下载时（下载后）"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:82
msgid "This filter runs after the image data is downloaded. It does **not** save bandwidth because the download has already happened. It does prevent further processing and storage of unwanted images. This filter is set in the :doc:`../config/options_cover_art_processing` configuration and applies to all providers."
msgstr ""
"此过滤器在图片数据下载后运行。它**不会**节省带宽，因为下载已经完成。但它能阻"
"止对不需要的图片进行进一步处理与存储。此过滤器在 :doc:`../config/"
"options_cover_art_processing` 配置中设置，适用于所有提供程序。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:84
msgid "**Size filter** - Rejects images below the configured minimum dimensions."
msgstr "**尺寸过滤器** - 拒绝低于配置最小尺寸的图像。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:87
msgid "At Assignment Time (per-file)"
msgstr "分配时（每个文件）"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:89
msgid "These filters run when images are being assigned to individual files. They compare each downloaded image against what is already embedded in that specific file, protecting existing embedded art from being downgraded. The filters are set in the :doc:`../config/options_cover` configuration and apply to all providers."
msgstr ""
"这些过滤器在图像分配给单个文件时运行。它们将每个下载的图像与该特定文件中已嵌"
"入的内容进行比较，以保护现有嵌入的艺术免遭降级。过滤器在:doc:`../config/"
"options_cover`配置中设置，并适用于所有提供程序。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:91
msgid "**\"Never replace with smaller\"** - If the file already has an embedded image of the same type (e.g. front) that is larger than the downloaded one, the downloaded image is skipped for that file."
msgstr ""
"**“永不用较小的替换”** - 如果文件已经有一个相同类型（例如正面）的嵌入图像，其"
"大小大于下载的图像，则下载的图像将被跳过该文件。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:92
msgid "**\"Never replace selected types\"** - If the file already has an embedded image whose type is in the user's \"never replace\" list, the downloaded image is skipped for that file."
msgstr ""
"**“永不替换选定类型”** - 如果文件已经有一个其类型在用户“永不替换”列表中的嵌入"
"图像，则下载的图像将被跳过该文件。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:94
msgid "These per-file filters only apply when \"Save images to tags\" is enabled. If you're only saving to external files, there are no embedded images to protect."
msgstr ""
"这些每个文件的过滤器仅在“将图像保存到标签”启用时适用。如果你只保存到外部文件"
"，则没有嵌入图像要保护。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:96
msgid "**Why per-file?** |br| |nl| Different files in the same album may have different embedded images (different sizes, different types). The filters compare against each file's own embedded images, not an album-wide aggregate."
msgstr ""
"**为什么按文件处理？** |br| |nl| 同一张专辑的不同文件可能有不同的内嵌图片（不"
"同尺寸、不同类型）。过滤器会针对每个文件自己的内嵌图片进行比较，而不是整个专"
"辑的汇总图片。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:99
msgid "**Interaction with CAA thumbnail size:** |br| |nl| If \"Never replace with smaller\" is enabled and the files already have large embedded images (e.g. 1200px), but the CAA image size is set to a smaller thumbnail (e.g. 500px default), the filter will always reject the downloaded images, effectively preventing any cover art update for those files. Users in this situation should increase the CAA image size setting to match or exceed their existing embedded image dimensions."
msgstr ""
"**与 CAA 缩略图大小交互：** |br| |nl| 如果启用了“永不替换为更小的”选项，并且"
"文件已经有大尺寸的内嵌图片（例如 1200px），但 CAA 缩略图大小设置为更小的值（"
"例如默认 500px），过滤器将始终拒绝下载的图片，实际上阻止了这些文件的封面更新"
"。在这种情况下，用户应增加 CAA 缩略图大小设置，以匹配或超过现有内嵌图片的尺寸"
"。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:104
msgid "Processing"
msgstr "处理"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:106
msgid "After filtering, images are processed (resized, converted) before being stored, based on the settings in the :doc:`../config/options_cover_art_processing` configuration. Processing runs in background threads and produces separate results for:"
msgstr ""
"过滤后，图片会根据 :doc:`../config/options_cover_art_processing` 配置中的设置"
"进行处理（调整大小、转换格式）后再存储。处理在后台线程中运行，并为以下内容生"
"成单独的结果："

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:108
msgid "**Tags** - Resized/converted for embedding in file tags (typically smaller)."
msgstr "**标签** - 调整大小/转换格式用于嵌入文件标签（通常尺寸较小）。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:109
msgid "**External files** - Resized/converted for saving along with the audio file."
msgstr "**外部文件** - 调整大小/转换格式用于与音频文件一起保存。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:111
msgid "The same source image can produce different output for tags vs. external files based on separate size/format settings."
msgstr "相同的源图片可以根据标签和外部文件的单独尺寸/格式设置产生不同的输出。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:115
msgid "Assignment"
msgstr "分配"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:117
msgid "Images are assigned to files in two scenarios:"
msgstr "图片在两种情况下分配给文件："

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:119
msgid "**Files already matched when cover art downloads:** |br| |nl| When cover art finishes downloading and files are already matched to the album, images are immediately assigned to all tracks and files. Per-file \"never replace\" filters run at this point."
msgstr ""
"**封面下载时文件已匹配：** |br| |nl| 当封面下载完成且文件已匹配到专辑时，图片"
"会立即分配给所有音轨和文件。此时会运行按文件“永不替换”过滤器。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:122
msgid "**Files matched after cover art is loaded:** |br| |nl| When a file is matched to a track that already has cover art, the track's images are copied to the file. Per-file \"never replace\" filters run here too, comparing against the file's original embedded images."
msgstr ""
"**封面加载后文件匹配：** |br| |nl| 当文件匹配到已有封面的音轨时，音轨的图片会"
"复制到文件。这里也会运行按文件“永不替换”过滤器，比较文件原始内嵌图片。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:125
msgid "In both cases, the same filtering logic applies, ensuring consistent behavior regardless of timing."
msgstr "在这两种情况下，相同的过滤逻辑都适用，确保行为一致，无论时间点如何。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:129
msgid "Saving"
msgstr "保存"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:131
msgid "When the user saves a file, Picard writes images based on two independent options set in the :doc:`../config/options_cover` configuration:"
msgstr ""
"当用户保存文件时，Picard 根据 :doc:`../config/options_cover` 配置中设置的独立"
"选项写入图像："

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:134
msgid "Save to Tags (embedding)"
msgstr "保存到标签（嵌入）"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:136
msgid "Images from the file's metadata ``file.metadata.images`` are embedded directly in the audio file's tags (ID3 APIC frames, Vorbis METADATA_BLOCK_PICTURE, MP4 covr atoms, etc.)"
msgstr ""
"来自文件元数据的 ``file.metadata.images`` 图像直接嵌入到音频文件的标签中（"
"ID3 APIC 帧、Vorbis METADATA_BLOCK_PICTURE、MP4 covr 原子等）"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:138
#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:148
msgid "Related options:"
msgstr "相关选项："

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:139
msgid "**Embed only one front image** - Only embed the first front image, skip others."
msgstr "**仅嵌入一张封面图像** - 仅嵌入第一张封面图像，跳过其他图像。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:140
msgid "**Never replace with smaller** - Protect existing larger embedded images."
msgstr "**永不替换为更小的** - 保护现有的较大嵌入图像。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:141
msgid "**Never replace selected types** - Protect specific image types from replacement."
msgstr "**永不替换选定类型** - 保护特定图像类型不被替换。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:144
msgid "Save to Files (external)"
msgstr "保存到文件（外部）"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:146
msgid "Images are written as separate files along with the audio file (e.g. ``cover.jpg``)."
msgstr "图像与音频文件一起作为单独文件写入（例如 ``cover.jpg``）。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:149
msgid "**Filename pattern** - Template for the external image filename."
msgstr "**文件名模式** - 外部图像文件名的模板。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:150
msgid "**Overwrite existing** - Whether to replace existing external image files."
msgstr "**覆盖现有** - 是否替换现有的外部图像文件。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:151
msgid "**Save only one front image** - Only save one front image externally."
msgstr "**仅保存一张封面图像** - 仅外部保存一张封面图像。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:152
msgid "**Use image type as filename** - Name files by their type (e.g. front.jpg, back.jpg)."
msgstr "**使用图像类型作为文件名** - 根据类型命名文件（例如 front.jpg, back.jpg）。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:154
msgid "Both options can be enabled simultaneously, and images will be both embedded and saved externally."
msgstr "两个选项可以同时启用，图片将被嵌入并外部保存。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:158
msgid "Image Storage Model"
msgstr "图片存储模型"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:160
msgid "Internally to Picard, each file-like object carries two sets of images:"
msgstr "在 Picard 内部，每个类文件对象携带两组图片："

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:166
msgid "Current Images"
msgstr "当前图片"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:167
msgid "Original Images"
msgstr "原始图片"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:168
msgid "**Album**"
msgstr "**专辑**"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:169
msgid "Downloaded from providers"
msgstr "从提供者下载"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:170
msgid "Aggregate of all matched files' embedded images"
msgstr "所有匹配文件嵌入图片的聚合"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:171
msgid "**File**"
msgstr "**文件**"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:172
msgid "What will be saved (filtered per-file)"
msgstr "将被保存（按文件过滤）"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:173
msgid "What was read from the file's tags on disk"
msgstr "从磁盘文件标签读取的内容"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:175
msgid "The album's \"original images\" represent what is currently embedded across all matched files. Individual file \"original images\" represent what is in that specific file. The per-file filters compare against the individual file's originals, not the album aggregate."
msgstr ""
"专辑的\"原始图片\"代表当前所有匹配文件嵌入的内容。单个文件的\"原始图片\"代表"
"该特定文件的内容。按文件过滤比较的是单个文件的原始图片，而不是专辑聚合。"

#: ../../appendices/coverart_processing.rst:179
msgid "Please see :doc:`../config/options_cover`, :doc:`../config/options_cover_art_archive`, :doc:`../config/options_local_files`, and :doc:`../config/options_cover_art_processing` for more information on configuring cover art providers, filters, and processing options."
msgstr ""
"请参阅 :doc:`../config/options_cover`、:doc:`../config/"
"options_cover_art_archive`、:doc:`../config/options_local_files` 和 :doc:`../"
"config/options_cover_art_processing`，以获取有关配置封面图片提供者、过滤器和"
"处理选项的更多信息。"
